    "reason": "Branches other/jep-fix-prevent-duplicate-organization-name and other/fix-race-condition added a concurrency guard for the per-product-pass-type organization name rule, which no unique index backs. BaseRepository gained TableLockMode, lock_table() and lock_values() (Postgres advisory/table locks that pin the session to the writer engine); utils.misc gained normalize_name() and escape_like(); OrganizationService.create_organization_with_location and update_organization now normalize, lock, then check. Separately, AssetService.get_asset now resolves tenancy through location.organization_id instead of an Asset column filter, and the suite gained cross-tenant 404 tests plus a duplicate-name 409 test. Updated core-infrastructure.md, utilities.md, services.md, extending.md, tests.md and overview.md; the other 9 module docs were unaffected.",
    "modules_updated": [
      "Core Infrastructure",
      "Utilities",
      "Services",
      "Extending Tap2Cloud",
      "Tests"
    ],
    "modules_unchanged": [
      "Application Bootstrap",
